 *  - Use restrict-qualified row-major pointers to help alias analysis.
 *  - Precompute loop-invariant scalar constants.
 *  - Factor common subexpressions (shared tridiagonal denominators).
 *  - Add OpenMP parallelization over the outer spatial dimension (i),
